# Words Documentation::PodSpelling takes as spelled right, named in .perlcriticrc.
# aspell is asked for American English, which is what the POD here is written in,
# so what is left is vocabulary no dictionary has -- commands, daemons, file and
# option names, module names -- and the pieces of a token aspell splits at a
# digit, like the IPv of IPv4.  A misspelling does not belong here: fix it.
#
# One word per line, sorted without regard to case, so that adding one is a
# one-line diff and nobody has to read the whole file to decide whether it is
# already in it.
